!   line  2  221475.00   000000.00 8E 000000.15 02     K CTL CM  CTL(SEOP),0.0($14),0.0($2)                                         LG000121
!   line  3                                            -                                                                           LG000122
!   line  4                                            -         **********  EOP TEST FOR SEOP CTL OP  **********                   LG000123
